## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical, beginner-friendly AWS event-driven design focusing on data quality and basic analytics. It verifies ability to wire S3, Lambda, and DynamoDB with proper security and error handling.

## Key Concepts
- S3 event triggers and object handling
- Lambda orchestration and idempotency
- CSV header validation and field normalization
- Simple data aggregation (completion rate)
- Storage formats (Parquet/JSON) and cost-conscious summaries
- IAM least-privilege, KMS encryption, DLQ handling

